{
  "_comment": [
    "D6 Layer 1 — Daleel's coverage map. DATA, not code.",
    "Adding an authority is an edit to this file plus its corpus files;",
    "no Python changes. That is the claim made to the panel, and this file",
    "is what makes it true.",
    "",
    "'variants' are matched against the D3-NORMALIZED question, so you do",
    "NOT need to list diacritic or hamza spellings (أ/ا, ة/ه, ى/ي are folded",
    "automatically). DO list: the definite article form, common short forms,",
    "colloquial names, English names, and real misspellings.",
    "",
    "Variants shorter than 4 characters are ignored by the matcher to avoid",
    "false positives."
  ],

